# Cursor Rules for Portfolio Playground

## Version Number Management

- The version number in `index.html` should auto-update with each commit
- Version format: `v1.0.X` where X is the git commit count (use `git rev-list --count HEAD` to get current count)
- The version number is displayed in the bottom-left corner of the screen
- **IMPORTANT**: Before committing, update the version number in `index.html` to match the commit count
- A git post-commit hook (`.git/hooks/post-commit`) is available but may need manual execution on Windows
- Always ensure the version number reflects the current commit count before pushing

## Code Style

- Use pixel art style for all UI elements (Courier New/Consolas monospace)
- Maintain consistent pixel art aesthetic throughout
- All text should use pixel-style rendering (crisp-edges, no antialiasing)

## Git Workflow

- Auto-commit and auto-push changes when requested
- Use descriptive commit messages
- Work on the design-overhaul branch unless specified otherwise
